# Glamer Gifter: "Flash. Flying. When this creature enters, choose up to one other target creature. Until end of turn, that creature has base power and toughness
# 4/4 and gains all creature types." Bot1 flashes it in during Bot2's turn 2 end step (Moxen paying {1}{U}) with Bot2's Memnite (1/1) as the target: the Gifter itself
# is refused ("other"), and the Memnite becomes a 4/4 (CR 613.4b) of every creature type (CR 613.1d) with its Artifact type kept. On Bot1's turn 3 the
# effects have ended (CR 514.2): it is a 1/1 with no creature types.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Glamer Gifter
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.End]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Glamer Gifter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Target(Glamer Gifter)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 4
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 4
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Subtypes = (every creature type)
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Power = 1
? Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Subtypes = Construct

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Glamer Gifter.Keywords = Flash; Flying
Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite.Toughness = 1
